  "body": "Unfortunately, we missed one edit in the DOM June 2019 that was outlined in the Mou: the joint copyright.\r\n\r\n[[\r\nCopyright © 2018 WHATWG (Apple, Google, Mozilla, Microsoft) and W3C® (MIT, ERCIM, Keio, Beihang). This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License. W3C liability and trademark rules apply.\r\n]]\r\n[sample document](https://www.w3.org/2019/01/whatwg-w3c-sample.html#acks)\r\n\r\nIs it possible to update the [DOM Review Draft — Published 18 June 2019](https://dom.spec.whatwg.org/review-drafts/2019-06/#acks) to include:\r\n\r\n```html\r\nand <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/\"><abbr title=\"World Wide Web Consortium\">W3C</abbr></a><sup>®</sup>\r\n(<a href=\"https://www.csail.mit.edu/\"><abbr title=\"Massachusetts Institute of Technology\">MIT</abbr></a>\r\n<a href=\"https://www.ercim.eu/\"><abbr title=\"European Research Consortium for Informatics and Mathematics\">ERCIM</abbr></a>,\r\n<a href=\"https://www.keio.ac.jp/\">Keio</a>, <a href=\"httpd://ev.buaa.edu.cn/\">Beihang</a>).\r\n```\r\n\r\nand\r\n\r\n```html\r\nW3C <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/Consortium/Legal/ipr-notice#Legal_Disclaimer\">liability</a>\r\nand <a href=\"https://www.w3.org/Consortium/Legal/ipr-notice#W3C_Trademarks\">trademark</a>\r\nrules apply.\r\n```\r\n\r\nSorry about not catching this earlier.\r\n\r\n@sideshowbarker @swickr\r\n\r\n",
